## About this package

This package is part of the ${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH} release of Emgu LiteRT. It contains:

- `Emgu.LiteRT.LM.dll`: the LiteRT-LM API (`Emgu.LiteRT.LM` namespace), calling LiteRT-LM's C API library (`liblitert-lm`) directly, for running large language models stored as `.litertlm` files: `Engine`, `Session` (blocking and streaming generation), `Conversation` (JSON chat messages, tools, thinking) and `LoadedFile` (model capabilities).

For online documentation please visit
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki/files/emgutf/${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH}/document-lite/index.html>

Release note can be found at
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki/index.php/Emgu_TF_Version_History#Emgu.TF-${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH}>

## Note

To deploy Emgu LiteRT LM to a specific platform, you will also need to add one of the ${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime.{platform} nuget packages to your executable project. Currently `liblitert-lm` (with `libLiteRt` and LiteRT-LM's `libGemmaModelConstraintProvider`) is included in ${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime.macos (Apple Silicon only) and the MAUI add-on ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui (or directly ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui.android - arm64-v8a and x86_64 - ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui.ios - iOS 26.4 or later, device and simulator - and ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui.macos - Mac Catalyst on Apple Silicon). Use the following link to search for the ${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime nuget packages:
<https://www.nuget.org/packages?q=${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime>
